{"id":"scandalo","lemma":"scandalo","pos":"noun","rank":2871,"glosses":["scandal"],"ipa":"/ˈskan.da.lo/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7d/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-scandalo.wav/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-scandalo.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"scandali"},"examples":[{"text":"Lo scandalo ha rovinato la sua carriera.","en":"The scandal ruined his career.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avere"},{"g":"ruined, damaged"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"his, hers, its","l":"suo"},{"g":"career"}]},{"text":"Hanno qualcosa a che fare con lo scandalo.","en":"They have something to do with the scandal.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"avere"},{"g":"something"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Ammette di essere coinvolto nello scandalo.","en":"He admits being involved in the scandal.","words":[{"g":"to admit","l":"ammettere"},{"g":"of"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"involved or implicated"},null,null]},{"text":"Lo scandalo rovinò la sua carriera.","en":"The scandal ruined his career.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to ruin","l":"rovinare"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"his, hers, its","l":"suo"},{"g":"career"}]},{"text":"Non ho niente a che fare con lo scandalo.","en":"I have nothing to do with the scandal.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"have","l":"avere"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}